%% ACTIRA — Sequence: upload to review
sequenceDiagram
  actor Analyst
  participant UI as React SPA
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant W as Job Worker
  participant DB as MongoDB
  actor Reviewer

  Analyst->>UI: Upload sample / logs
  UI->>API: POST /api/logs/upload
  API->>DB: create log_job
  API->>W: enqueue / claim
  W->>W: parse → extract → enrich → correlate
  W->>W: RAG + LLM playbook
  W->>W: HiTL decide status
  W->>DB: insert incident
  UI->>API: GET /api/incidents
  API->>DB: query
  API-->>UI: incidents
  Reviewer->>UI: Open Review Queue
  UI->>API: GET /api/review/queue
  Reviewer->>UI: Approve
  UI->>API: POST /api/review/{id}
  API->>DB: atomic update + audit
  API-->>UI: 200 or 409
